ines":["The roads of this town stretch north and south, and east and west.\nBecause of that, we get all sorts of people coming through."]},{"at":[18,6],"source_script":"MauvilleCity_EventScript_Woman","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WOMAN_4","source_id":4,"local_id":4,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_LOOK_AROUND","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Have you been to RYDEL'S CYCLES yet?\nRYDEL, the owner, is a very generous man."]},{"at":[17,14],"source_script":"MauvilleCity_EventScript_SchoolKidM","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SCHOOL_KID_M","source_id":5,"local_id":5,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Hi, do you check out TV at all?\nThey've added a bunch of cool new shows recently.\nTV is so cool. I've seen my friends on TV just out of the blue.\nAnd, sometimes, they even put you on TV without telling you.\nI wish I would be on TV sometime.\nThat's why I think you should check out TVs whenever you can."]},{"at":[8,6],"source_script":"MauvilleCity_EventScript_Wally","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_MAUVILLE_CITY_WALLY","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WALLY","source_id":6,"local_id":6,"source_local":"LOCALID_MAUVILLE_WALLY","facing":"up","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"满充","lines":["WALLY: Aww, UNCLE, please?\nI want to challenge this GYM and see how much better I've become.\nPlease? May I, please?"]},{"at":[9,6],"source_script":"MauvilleCity_EventScript_WallysUncle","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_MAUVILLE_CITY_WALLYS_UNCLE","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_POKEFAN_M","source_id":7,"local_id":7,"source_local":"LOCALID_MAUVILLE_WALLYS_UNCLE","facing":"left","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_LEFT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["UNCLE: It's because of POKéMON that this boy's got more pep, I suppose… But he's become a bit too peppy…"]},{"at":[